# Comment Demo

## Access

- The Comments section is open to any visitor
- No login required

## Storage

- Comments are stored in the visitor's own browser via `localStorage` only
- There is no backend or database
- Comments are **not** shared across visitors or devices

## Form validation

- Require both a **name** and a **comment body**
- Reject empty submission of either field

## Rendering safety

- Escape/sanitize submitted text before rendering it back into the page
- **Never** insert raw user input via `innerHTML`

## UI note

- Include a visible note stating that comments are local to each browser
